35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Last year we barely met. The shared house year had no space for alone time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more than a whole house. That is a big difference.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The island houses have one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold. That sounds stressful.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two days total. The train is only ninety minutes. The train is much better.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The all-in rate charges light eaters the same as big eaters. That feels unfair to me.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if the train is faster, does that mean we have more time together?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, if we rent a house, the bill is one even split. That solves the payment issue.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, but if the house has one bathroom, I might not sleep well.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, yes, less travel means more actual holiday time. I prefer the train.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, a single bill is nice, but I worry about the food costs if we buy separately.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The city option lets us have alone time in streets and shops. That might help.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The island house is cheaper per head, but the bathroom issue is real.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"The inn has fixed meal times. I like knowing when to eat, but the room is shared.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The city has trains every few minutes. I can move without planning. That is good for me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,The valley inn includes meals. That might be the most predictable cost.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards the city for the balance of togetherness and space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am worried about the island bathroom, but the cost is appealing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am concerned about the island bathroom. The inn might be safer for my sleep.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,The city or the valley. Both avoid the long ferry wait.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"The valley inn includes meals, which helps with my budget anxiety.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
